"Email us directly with questions, corrections, or collaboration proposals."

#: .\templates\pages\contact.html:15
msgid "Електронна пошта"
msgstr "Email"

#: .\templates\pages\contact.html:21
msgid "З чим можна написати"
msgstr "What to Write to Us About"

#: .\templates\pages\contact.html:23
