msgstr ""
"These terms are governed by the law of Ukraine. Disputes are resolved "
"through negotiation, and if agreement can't be reached, in court in "
"accordance with the law of Ukraine."

#: .\templates\pages\terms.html:110
msgid "Зміни умов"
