" to old commit hashes in commit messages are replaced with new commit hashes"
" (abbreviated to the same length as the old reference).  Use this flag to "
"turn off updating commit hashes in commit messages."
msgstr ""

#: .\venv\Lib\site-packages\git_filter_repo.py:2050
