"object specifies an encoding for the commit message, the message is re-"
"encoded into UTF-8."
msgstr ""

#: .\venv\Lib\site-packages\git_filter_repo.py:2054
msgid ""
"Filtering of names & emails (see also --name-callback and --email-callback)"
msgstr ""

